This image builds on Breeze TTS 2's inference code
(https://github.com/breezeblue-ai/breeze-tts, Apache License 2.0), which it clones at
a pinned commit and imports unmodified. server/yggdrasil_breeze_fast.py contains a
copy of upstream's streaming frame loop, adapted.

The Breeze TTS 2 model weights (https://huggingface.co/BreezeBlue/Breeze-TTS-2) are
NOT part of this repository and are NOT covered by its license. They are licensed by
RESONIA, Inc. (BreezeBlue) under the BreezeBlue Research and Non-Commercial License
Agreement, which also governs derivative models and self-hosted outputs: research and
non-commercial use only; commercial use requires a separate written license from
BreezeBlue. The `weights` service downloads them from Hugging Face; by running it you
accept that agreement (its text ships with the weights, as LICENSE in the model dir).
